    "スレの右上のメニューから「オフライン用に保存」を選ぶと、電波がなくても読めます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose “Save for Offline” from the menu at the top right of a thread to read it without a connection."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
